# Coverage run, variant (chat 15): 5:4 wearing the disguise 5:6's woman offers (0x4A65 bit 0,
# set by 5:6 at 0x99BC when the party says YES) and with the shrines untouched (0x4A6A & 3 = 0:
# 5:4 clears the disguise on every step otherwise). The patrols then ask "WHAT ARE YOU DOING
# HERE?" and the password (HARASH) and authority (TYRANTHRAXUS) questions come up. The flag is
# set by shortcut (logged) on the main line's checkpoint before 5:4, "valjevo3"; so is Cadorna's
# fate (0x4ABE, 255 once settled) back to unsettled, for the evidence at 0xADA6. Each event is
# walked to from the arrival ("fresh"), so the alarm one fight raises doesn't hide the rest.
rules playthrough.plan
start chat13a_latest/valjevo3
shortcut flag 4A65 or 1 the disguise from 5:6's woman, as a player who says YES wears it
shortcut flag 4ABE set 0 Cadorna's fate not yet settled (a player who came to Valjevo before the textile house)
travel 5:4
expect 5:4
cover 5:4 40 all fresh
status
stop
